<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your flight from {!Case.Departure_City__c} to {!Case.Arrival_City__c} on&nbsp;{!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If announcements too loud use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I was concerned to hear about the performance of our entertainment system with your <b><i>-Audio Technica/BOSE headphones-</i></b> and how this affected your enjoyment of the flight. PA volumes are subject to regulation for emergency announcements, so they do need to be set for best performance with our own equipment. We are aware that some customers prefer to bring their own headphones on board, but due to the wide variety of products available, we cannot guarantee that they will be compatible with our own settings.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If too many/inappropriate announcements use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We want all our customers to have a comfortable and pleasant journey when they travel with us, so we were concerned to learn about the excessive announcements on QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c}. While operational announcements are subject to regulation, the cabin crew and technical crew should use their judgment to make appropriate service and location updates throughout the flight.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">So that we can learn from your feedback, I have forwarded a copy of your experience to our<i> </i><b><i>-Cabin/Tech-</i></b> Crew Management. Your comments will be used to improve the performance of the team concerned.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I’m grateful for you taking the time to get in touch with us about your experience, and hope we can make you more comfortable next time you travel.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>